# Netlify redirect rules for iwctpainting.com
# Docs: https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/
#
# /card — dynamic business card QR code target.
# The printed QR code points to /card; change the destination URL below
# (and redeploy) to repoint every printed card without reprinting.
# 302 = temporary, so browsers/search engines don't cache the destination.

# The "!" forces this rule over the meta-refresh fallback page Astro builds
# at /card/ (from the redirects entry in astro.config.mjs).
/card    /contact    302!
